      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PITMAN GO JACK (1) form hasn't been great but has the inside draw. Last time finished 5th over 388m at this track beaten 9 lengths (22.94) behind Princess Energy in a Maiden on October 1. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Tough to beat if on-song. WICKED BLAZE (2) produced a moderate run last time when fifth at The Gardens over 400m behind Black Aura (24.06) in a Maiden. Better than last start and can bounce back. RIPPER MULWEE (7) has an honest record despite remaining a maiden after 10 starts. Is better than last start when out of the placings, finishing sixth (23.91) at The Gardens. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. ZIPPING KAREEM (5) cannot be dismissed although new to this venue.",
